  "message": "Coach (auto-open schedule live): Lift Log now opens straight into today's scheduled workout.\nMon/Thu: Rest + Z2 incline walk. Tue: Shoulders (Side) + Calves (35-40 min). Wed: Arms (All, bi/tri supersets, 35-40 min).\nFri: Legs (Quads; Week B Hamstrings 11/27). Sat: Chest (Upper; Week B Mid 11/28). Sun: Back (Upper; Week B Mid 11/29) + photos.\nTomorrow (Fri) opens straight into Legs (Quads): Squat 325x5 top set + 2 back-offs. Switch to Body Recomp to get the new 3,300 kcal chicken-based meal plan, 10k steps, and 140 oz water.",
